      {
        "id": "hamilton-necessary-condition",
        "moduleId": "m3-hamilton",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "哈密顿图的必要条件",
        "markdown": "设图 $G=(V,E)$ 是哈密顿图，则对于 $V$ 的每个非空子集 $S$，均有\n\n$$W(G-S) \\leqslant |S|$$\n\n其中 $W(G-S)$ 是图 $G-S$ 的连通分支数，$|S|$ 为集合 $S$ 中的元素个数。\n\n教材例 10-9 用它作否定判断：取 $S=\\{v_1, v_4\\}$ 时，$G-S$ 有 3 个连通分支 $\\{v_2\\}$、$\\{v_7\\}$、$\\{v_3, v_5, v_6, v_8\\}$，而 $|S|=2$，不满足条件，故该图不是哈密顿图。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e1f9c42a00f16944b6b1b76c",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000066"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "图论",
                "欧拉图与哈密顿图"
              ],
              "lineStart": 13858,
              "lineEnd": 14017,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0007/images/fbe48ff6b3d7c13c88d794628ab2bc5a202751e3b04b8e3ef10041d4b7b5a20a.jpg",
                "parts/part-0007/images/1112e464cc286b26710f11ea588eb7296d3051d4d54767b86edb0be9ed302ab8.jpg",
                "parts/part-0007/images/743c56876d6fe499344a208c40977b792f59489f0be98a09f70be01040483f08.jpg",
                "parts/part-0007/images/edc4db7b0c251e5ceb059d7df2f0ae70fe402772be5916662c60784a60b938ec.jpg",
                "parts/part-0007/images/6173c3eeb87088a9c43e9de982da399650c5a27af2a673b3c7d0430c4193acb8.jpg",
